      "content": "wait, you already spoke to the lead designer? i didn't realize we were moving that fast on nerfs. i was looking at the raw win-rate telemetry for Xylos's ultimate combo, and it's sitting at 85% in high-elo matches. that's not just \"aggressive play,\" that's basically broken. are you sure we shouldn't be looking at a significant reduction in the cooldown or damage before we commit to the marketing push?",
